└── README.md
```

## Tools & Skills Used
- **Python** — Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn
- **SQL** — Aggregations, CASE statements, window analysis
- **Data Analysis** — Trend analysis, cohort comparison, KPI tracking
- **Visualisation** — Multi-panel dashboard, annotated charts

## How to Run
```bash
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn
python notebooks/analysis.py
```

